{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/logo.png?t=1749504672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join two college girls on a trip to an abandoned cabin. The cabin has had numerous rumors about missing people going to it, and so, the girls are investigating both that and the cabin\u2019s history for their final project. The cabin has a mysterious mirror with a thousand faces on it, too. Will their faces be added to the mirror frame like the rest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Phoebe and Onyx, our main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/Phoebe.jpg?t=1749504672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/extras/Onyx.jpg?t=1749504672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8k words of dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice acted segments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 endings, including a true ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A CG gallery with over 20 unique CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Potential bonus scenes of the two main girls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800840?t=1749504672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/8e0a1252069d9d226ab288c0d0d9f49693b534d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749504672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800840/425400c041bd41354a9cd8f76dd4c925b1259cc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t